This repository contains build scripts, a Robolectric loader plugin, test rigs and
documentation, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It builds on the work of others:

* The Android Open Source Project (https://source.android.com). The build reads AOSP's
  Android.bp files and compiles libandroid_runtime.so and its dependencies from AOSP
  sources, which are downloaded at build time and are not part of this repository. The
  files in patches/ are changes from later AOSP commits, under the license of the files
  they modify (Apache License 2.0).

* Robolectric (https://robolectric.org), Apache License 2.0. The loader plugin implements
  Robolectric's NativeRuntimeLoader plugin interface and follows the logic of Robolectric's
  DefaultNativeRuntimeLoader. The upstream test harness runs Robolectric's own test
  suites, which are downloaded at test time.

* The LLVM Project (libc++, libc++abi, libunwind, compiler-rt; Apache License 2.0 with
  LLVM exceptions), the Rust project (standard library; MIT or Apache License 2.0), the
  GNU C Library and the GCC runtime from Debian 11. These are downloaded and verified at
  build time and are not part of this repository.

